Runtime configuration is provisioned per device and is not embedded in the image.

Expected future files:
  presence-sensor.env    root:root             0600
  panel-supervisor.env   root:root             0600
  vocabulary-panel.env  root:vocabulary-panel 0640
  panel-ui.env           root:panel-ui          0640
  touch-input.name       root:root             0644, exactly one observed line
  touch-input.phys       root:root             0644, exactly one observed line

Every input event remains root:root 0600, including an exactly identified touch
device. ADR 0005 reserves raw input for the supervisor; mdev revokes legacy
group grants. Neither panel-ui nor vocabulary-panel may join bhp-touch, generic
input, or another raw-device group. The UI consumes normalized observations.

Tailscale state and Lexinet credentials belong under /var/lib/beaglebone-house-panel
or /var/lib/tailscale with mode 0600 and must never enter diagnostics or images.
